sequenceDiagram
    participant Worker
    participant DB
    participant Push as Push delivery
    Worker->>DB: Write heartbeat
    Push--xWorker: Delivery unavailable
    loop Every 20 seconds
        Worker->>DB: Find due queued jobs
        Worker->>DB: Process and update job
        Worker->>DB: Write heartbeat
    end
    DB-->>Worker: Worker status visible to metrics
